{
  "comment": [
    "The --gpu downcalls a compiled program's native image needs: the CUDA driver API and",
    "Metal shapes the shipped $Gpu* classes bind, one entry per distinct shape. A -o X.class/.jar",
    "--gpu output carries this file under META-INF/native-image/, so native-image picks it up with",
    "no configuration; without it the image refuses the binding and --gpu silently runs the CPU",
    "fallback on a machine with a device (.kb/gpu.md, \"Native image\"). The same entries are in",
    "rontolisp's own reachability-metadata.json; NativeImageForeignConfigTest pins this file",
    "against both drivers' bindings in both directions."
